  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n(13, 57, 111)\n\n__**(13 × 4)**__ + __**(57 + 2)**__ = 111\n\n__**52 + 59**__ = 111\n\n111 = 111 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n(11, 49, 95)\n\n__(11 × 4)__ + __(49 + 2)__ = 95\n\n__44 + 51__ = 95\n\n95 = 95 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) (9, 41, 79) \n\n__(9 × 4)__ + __(41 + 2)__ = 79\n\n__36 + 43__ = 79\n\n**79 = 79 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) (12, 53, 109) \n\n__(12 × 4)__ + __(53 + 2)__ = 109\n\n__48 + 55__ = 109\n\n113 ≠ 109 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) (8, 37, 73)\n\n__(8 × 4)__ + __(37 + 2)__ = 73\n\n__32 + 39__ = 73\n\n72 ≠ 73 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) (10, 54, 11)\n\n__(10 × 4)__ + __(54 + 2)__ = 11\n\n__40 + 56__ = 11\n\n96 ≠ 11 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options '(9, 41, 79)' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
